Data licenses / Licences des données

The MIT license above applies ONLY to the smt2parquet source code. The
generated Parquet files contain medical terminologies sourced from the
Serveur Multi-Terminologies (SMT) operated by the Agence du Numérique en
Santé (ANS) — https://smt.esante.gouv.fr/ — and remain subject to the
license of each source terminology:

  - CIM-10 FR PMSI : CC BY-NC-ND 3.0 IGO
    https://smt.esante.gouv.fr/terminologie-cim-10/
  - CCAM           : Licence Ouverte v2.0 (Etalab, LOv2)
    https://smt.esante.gouv.fr/terminologie-ccam/
  - ADICAP         : Licence Ouverte v2.0 (Etalab, LOv2)
    https://smt.esante.gouv.fr/terminologie-adicap/
  - ATC            : CC BY-ND 3.0 IGO
    https://smt.esante.gouv.fr/terminologie-atc/

Each generated Parquet file also embeds its own license in the footer
key-value metadata (key "license"). Always check the SMT portal for the
authoritative and up-to-date terms of each terminology.
